              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Chïpote chi anka tïkwïl nyo ighöy körkeyïn nyo kipötöy anta nyo kitongöy, akïsagh ompö wïnyat. Ghöchini ECHOTYON saghata körkeyïntin.’ Kuyokwï pich löwïr lö, ‘Amen!’*",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
